# Build context is the repo root; BuildKit reads this file for Dockerfile.web only.
# Allowlist: the web workspace, the shared packages, the instance config and its
# branding images. Content (concept_sets/…) is not part of the image.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/web/
!packages/
!config.json
!legacy/logo.png
!legacy/favicon.png
!branding/
!docker/nginx.conf
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
apps/web/dist
apps/web/public
